OL,3,GNEWSAPublic meetings to be held on
OL,4,Adisputed housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FConsultation meetings are being held in
OL,7,Fpart of Kent after the government
OL,8,Fordered a council to continue
OL,9,Fprogressing its plan for new homes amid
OL,10,Fconcerns about water supply.
OL,12,FThree Kent MPs have called for a
OL,13,Fmeeting with Housing Minister Matthew
OL,14,FPennycook, citing concerns over water
OL,15,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
