OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPublic meetings to be held on
OL,4,Adisputed housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir request comes after the
OL,7,Fgovernment directed Tonbridge and
OL,8,FMalling Borough Council to proceed with
OL,9,Fits plan for new homes, despite
OL,10,Fcouncillors voting on 3 September not
OL,11,Fto approve the local plan for
OL,12,Fconsultation.
OL,14,FA government spokesperson said all
OL,15,Fareas had to play their part in
OL,16,Fbuilding new homes, and water companies
OL,17,Falso had a duty to plan and deliver
OL,18,Finfrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
